tweets.title:
This monthly chart on $INTC helps to put this recent parabolic move into perspective.  Note that the breakout above 2021 peaks near $62 proved to be a big positive development given the volume of INTC's move, and now the ability to eclipse former all-time highs from over 25 years ago as volume continued to expand over the last month was also still quite bullish.
@IBDinvestors @marketsurge 

While there's a political factor at work here given the government involvement, the volume and price action tells a powerful story.  Weakness, when this occurs potentially in late May, could help create a bit better risk/reward for INTC, but the volume difference between recent leaders like INTC and laggards like PYPL tells an important story.

Great to meet and speak with @MichaelSelig at Milken Institute @MilkenInstitute 2026

